{{PageBanner|Clb l 008 1 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the idle game '''Survive! Mola Mola!''' (生きろ！マンボウ！, ''Ikiro！ Manbō！'', '''Live! Sunfish!''') was originally held from April 3rd, 2015 to May 3rd, 2015. The collaboration includes an [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration the period.<br>
The game is published by [http://selectbutton.jp/ SELECT BUTTON Inc].

==Event Information==
The fragile giant sunfish Mola Mola returns to the Cat Army for one more adventure with the Battle Cats...<br>
{{Color|#CC4125|'''On from August 28th (11:00 AM) until September 18th (10:59 AM)!'''}}<br>

{{Color|#E97132|'''● "Survive! Mola Mola!" Limited Capsule Set!'''}}<br>
Only now, visit the Rare Capsule Machine and tap the "Survive! Mola Mola!" tab at the top of the menu to draw for a special set including Mola Mola! units available only from this collaboration event!<br>
Plus, Mola King and Baby Mola units have had new Talents unlocked for this iteration of the event!<br>
Tap the Capsule banner to confirm available units and their abilities!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> The units shown above will be available only during this event. Please be aware that there is a chance that you may also collect non-collab characters from collab event banners.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> The units shown above will be available only from the collab banners at the Rare Capsules. Tap the banner at the top of the screen to switch between Capsules sets.

{{Color|#E97132|'''● Rewards Restored for Limited Map "Survive! Mola Mola!"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Clear rewards have been reset'''}} for limited collab stages!<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this collab event to test your Cats' might in these limited collab stages!

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Map: "Survive! Mola Mola!"'''}}<br>
Take on a sinister school of undersea foes!

Rewards:<br>
Special unit "Meowla Meowla"<br>
Rewards:<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''XP'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Get a 100% chance to collect this unit by using a Treasure Radar.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> This unit cannot be collected again if it was earned from a previous collab event.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Map: "300 Million Dead Molas"'''}}<br>
A gruesome gallery of sea creatures awaits!

Timed Score Rewards: {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, battle items'''}}, and more!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Map: "Manbosaki Strikes!"'''}}<br>
End the Mola Mola queen of pop's record-breaking reign over the undersea music charts!

Timed Score Rewards: {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, battle items'''}}, and more!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> If you have already cleared this stage a certain number of times, you will have to wait until you can challenge it again.

{{Color|#E97132|'''・Limited Arena of Honor Event: "Aqua Paradiso"'''}}<br>
A limited Catclaw Dojo collab stage featuring a terrifying torrent of underwater foes only available in the Arena of Honor!

Challenge Arena of Honor maps by visiting the Catclaw Dojo from The Battle Cats title menu.

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but it may take a short while after the end of this event before your rewards are delivered. Thank you for your patience!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Rewards must be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from The Battle Cats title menu.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Rewards in the Mailbox will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> You must be connected to an online network to have your score recorded. Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Dojo event scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.

